{"content":[{"id":"tpl-intent-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Intent","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"b003cefa","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A register of legal entities, modelled on the CDM ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"cdm.base.staticdata.party.LegalEntity","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" type: each record carries a required name and optional identifiers (LEI, BIC, MIC, RED ID, country code, other). It serves any screen or process that needs to pick a legal entity — counterparties, agreements, obligors — and gives the firm one place to keep entity identifiers instead of free-text duplicates. Records carry a draft/active/retired lifecycle so a retired entity can be kept for history without being selectable for new business.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-scope-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Scope","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"9057af9d","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"IN: one ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" entity (name, status) with an embedded list of ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"EntityIdentifier","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" rows (identifier + identifier type); uniqueness of the LEI across the register; the draft/active/retired lifecycle; the standard search screen and edit form.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"7a115223","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"OUT (non-goals): natural persons and the wider ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"Party","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" model; relationships between entities (parents, branches); links from trades, agreements or collateral to a legal entity; external registry validation (e.g. live LEI lookup against GLEIF) — the LEI is stored and format-checked, not verified against the registry.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-scenarios-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Scenarios","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"3b52a950","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"None — the bean's standard screens cover create/edit/browse; no multi-step journey is in scope.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-requirements-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Requirements","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"d99375f6","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"R1: WHEN a legal entity is retired, the system SHALL not delete or otherwise modify the record or its identifiers — the retired row stays readable as history.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"620b8dab","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"R2: The system SHALL offer a legal entity for selection as a reference only while it is draft or active; a retired entity is never offered. (The register exposes this as its selection view; consuming specs pick over it.)","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"a8fc1817","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"R3: WHEN a legal entity's status changes, the system SHALL accept only the transitions draft→active, draft→retired and active→retired; retired is terminal.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"b00fe63a","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"P1: The system SHALL keep at most one identifier of type LEI across the whole register — two legal entities never share an LEI, and one entity never carries two.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"1f7590aa","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"P2: The system SHALL accept a LEI-typed identifier only when its value is 20 alphanumeric characters (ISO 17442). [ASSUMED: the format applies only to identifiers whose type is LEI.]","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-datamodel-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Data model","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"cac1328c","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":3,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"bean: LegalEntity","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"ecd54189","type":"table","props":{"textColor":"default"},"content":{"type":"tableContent","rows":[{"cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"field","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"kind","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"required","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"notes","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}}]},{"cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"name","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"text","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"yes","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}}]},{"cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"status","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"lifecycle(draft, active, retired)","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"yes","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"default(draft)","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}}]},{"cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"identifiers","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"embeddedlist(EntityIdentifier)","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"no","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}}]}],"columnWidths":[null,null,null,null],"headerRows":1},"children":[]},{"id":"e8ae00c6","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Artifacts: ","styles":{}},{"type":"link","href":"#spec-attachment/entity_descriptors/cdm.party.LegalEntity.json","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Entity descriptor","styles":{}}]},{"type":"text","text":" · ","styles":{}},{"type":"link","href":"#spec-attachment/ui/cdm.party.LegalEntity.js","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Default form","styles":{}}]}],"children":[]},{"id":"12b0b5e5","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":3,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"bean: EntityIdentifier","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"e0c2eb72","type":"table","props":{"textColor":"default"},"content":{"type":"tableContent","rows":[{"cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"field","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"kind","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"required","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"notes","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}}]},{"cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"identifier","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"text","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"yes","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}}]},{"cells":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"identifierType","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"choice(BIC, LEI, MIC, REDID, COUNTRY_CODE, OTHER)","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"text","text":"yes","styles":{}}],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[],"props":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"}}]}],"columnWidths":[null,null,null,null],"headerRows":1},"children":[]},{"id":"3a110b19","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Artifacts: ","styles":{}},{"type":"link","href":"#spec-attachment/entity_descriptors/cdm.party.EntityIdentifier.json","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Entity descriptor","styles":{}}]},{"type":"text","text":" · ","styles":{}},{"type":"link","href":"#spec-attachment/ui/cdm.party.EntityIdentifier.js","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Default form","styles":{}}]}],"children":[]},{"id":"3fe0419d","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rules the table cannot carry:","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"e68dad25","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"P1 — LEI uniqueness across the register.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"613198cd","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"P2 — LEI format (20 alphanumeric characters).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"d8b9ada4","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"R3 — lifecycle transitions: draft→active, draft→retired, active→retired; retired is terminal.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"29891b99","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ported from CDM ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"cdm.base.staticdata.party.LegalEntity","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" and ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"cdm.base.staticdata.party.EntityIdentifier","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":"; the ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"status","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" field is this spec's addition (CDM carries no lifecycle). The identifierType values are the flattened CDM ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"EntityIdentifierTypeEnum","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":", which does carry COUNTRY_CODE and OTHER.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-ui-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"User interface","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"382a3d74","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The bean's standard search screen and edit form. Guidance, not acceptance-tested: on the edit form, the identifier list reads as a simple add/remove list of rows (type + value), with the LEI row visibly marked so the 20-character rule is discoverable.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-dependencies-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Dependencies","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"3c7b5631","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"cdm.base.staticdata.party.LegalEntity (vocabulary, from the cdm corpus)","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"f9593b11","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"cdm.base.staticdata.party.EntityIdentifier (vocabulary, from the cdm corpus)","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"3699383f","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"cdm.base.staticdata.party.EntityIdentifierTypeEnum (vocabulary, from the cdm corpus)","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"7075c6fb","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"ISO 17442 (vocabulary — LEI format)","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-constraints-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Constraints","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"08b17531","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Considered, none apply: authorization (any signed-in user, the platform's default), performance, volume, availability, audit, privacy, locale, cost.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-acceptance-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Acceptance criteria","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"9a98e96b","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A1 (verifies P1): WHEN a second legal entity is saved with an LEI identical to one already on the register, the system SHALL reject the save; and WHEN one entity is given two LEI-typed identifiers, the system SHALL reject it.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"bc0a2a10","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A2 (verifies P2): WHEN a LEI-typed identifier is saved with a value that is not exactly 20 alphanumeric characters, the system SHALL reject the save; WHEN a BIC-typed or other-typed identifier of any length is saved, the system SHALL accept it.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"d6ec4efb","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A3 (verifies R1): WHEN a legal entity is retired, the system SHALL keep the record and its identifiers readable and unchanged.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"1996bc15","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A4 (verifies R2): WHEN the register's selection view is queried, the system SHALL return only draft and active entities; a retired entity SHALL not appear among the offered choices.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"dee70aa6","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A5 (verifies R3): WHEN a retired legal entity is moved back to draft or active, the system SHALL reject the change; WHEN a draft is activated or retired, and an active is retired, the system SHALL accept the change.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-migration-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Migration & compatibility","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"918c7d9d","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"None — new entity, nothing to migrate.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-artifacts-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Artifacts","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"d97747d2","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A ","styles":{}},{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity","styles":{"code":true}},{"type":"text","text":" entity with its search screen and edit form, including the embedded identifier list.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"6f4a5d05","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":3,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Derived from the Data model","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"3c385966","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implied by the bean blocks in the Data model and regenerated by the platform - do not edit this block; author above it what the catalog cannot derive.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"a3ce7395","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity - persistence.entity (persistence): The entity class with its builder, its descriptor + jsontype entry, its migration and table, and its tests; the descriptor is authored at spec time as the bean's entity-descriptor attachment (entity_descriptors/{qualified-descriptor-name}.json).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"c3238230","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity - observer.sheet (observer): The observer sheet: the entity's only remote surface, reads and writes.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"823d11ac","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity - ui.defaultForm (ui): The default form of one row, rendered wherever the row is viewed or edited: its layout JS, authored at spec time as the spec's ui/{qualified-descriptor-name}.js attachment and shipped beside the entity class.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"1138d813","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"LegalEntity.status - validation.rule (persistence): default(draft) - enforced on save and covered by a generated test","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"dc05e88f","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"EntityIdentifier - embeddedBean (bean): A bean another bean embeds: its class with its builder, its descriptor + jsontype entry and its tests - a plain bean with NO persistence descriptor, so no migration, no table and no sheet; it lives inside the row of the bean that embeds it, and its descriptor is authored at spec time as its entity-descriptor attachment (entity_descriptors/{qualified-descriptor-name}.json).","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"8961cb8a","type":"bulletListItem","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"EntityIdentifier - ui.defaultForm (ui): The default form of one row, rendered wherever the row is viewed or edited: its layout JS, authored at spec time as the spec's ui/{qualified-descriptor-name}.js attachment and shipped beside the entity class.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"tpl-openq-h","type":"heading","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left","level":2,"isToggleable":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Open Questions","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"4d365eb3","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"None — the author settled shape, lifecycle and LEI strictness on the scope form; the remaining defaults are recorded as [ASSUMED] markers.","styles":{}}],"children":[]},{"id":"d6634190-b957-4ae5-82e3-4ce89bc2d5b0","type":"paragraph","props":{"backgroundColor":"default","textColor":"default","textAlignment":"left"},"content":[],"children":[]}],"comments":[]}